# Generated by .claude/hooks/session-stop.sh on every Stop — necessarily *after* the
# session's last commit, so tracking it left the tree dirty at the end of every session
# with nothing to do about it but make one more commit that the next append dirtied
# again. Only this one generated file: hand-authored playtest records live in the same
# directory and are expected in version control by the qa-plan, story-done and
# test-evidence-review skills.
production/session-logs/session-log.md
